WEBVTT

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.240
I lost again!

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.570
Rossweisse-san, I can read the expressions on your face.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.780
It's true, they're so obvious.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:20.200
Even considering that it is your first time playing,

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.200
it's shocking how bad you are at Old maid.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.870
It's been a while since we last visited Phenex house.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.210
Eh? Yes, you're right...

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.340
Rias-sama,

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.590
