00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.430
Actually,

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.520
I wanted to ask for your advice regarding my brother.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.650
Riser...

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.820
You want to talk about Riser?

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:24.070
Yes.

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:27.200
I assume you've heard the stories about him.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.660
Like, how he does nothing but mope about since that incident.

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.410
Riser?

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:33.290
I've heard the rumours, too...

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.660
Who is he?

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:39.290
He's from Phenex family
 and Rias-oneesama's ex-fiancé.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:43.550
Fiancé!? How romantic!

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:46.550
It sounds so noble!

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:49.930
Hang on. If he is her ex-fiancé, then...

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:51.430
You see,

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:55.390
Issei-san crashed their engagement party

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:58.350
