00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:03.150
Issei-san won and he took back Rias-oneesama.

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:05.820
On the other hand,
 Riser-san had never lost before, so...

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.740
Riser still hasn't recovered from that, right?

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:17.910
I probably shouldn't have come here, but...

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.460
I only have your place to turn to for this.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:23.300
My place? What do you mean?

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.630
When I was asking for advise on how to help my brother,

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:32.550
I was told that he should learn the so called fortitude that Rias-sama's peerage possesses.

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:35.310
That is what your household is famous for.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.640
Fortitude!?

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:39.440
Fortitude, huh...

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.690
A certain someone knows all about that.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:46.650
More precisely...

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.860
He should be ashamed of himself!

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:52.410
I can't believe he's been sulking for half a year because of one loss.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:54.580
He even says that he is afraid of Dragons!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.330
Since then, he hasn't participated in a single rating game.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.710
Gossip magazines have been writing whatever they want about him.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.580
He got traumatized by one battle with Issei-sama,

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:04.090
