00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:11.130
He should man up and learn from the experience of that defeat and grow stronger.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.890
It's really, <i>really </i>shameful!

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.470
But...

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:25.150
