00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:41.250
Well, I am the reason behind it all.
He just needs to learn fortitude, right?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:43.250
Leave it to me!

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.380
I'm all about fortitude.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:48.130
So Ravel, don't worry about it anymore.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.760
Well... If you absolutely insist...

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:56.260
I-I will accept your help Issei-sama.

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:59.810
